cogH5YdBicssllcmZkWHibIWQ%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}, {"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=ce1606b4&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9FeeSgjCUz9ZK7hCt28Vkkq10L2j7aAWJWpH2xhYESicsNa9hwoV6uH9dMzHD99z0Bj07jPx1DJgzWleLC1k6fnTAwqwkuIXpbic4c%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}, {"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=91672ae1&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FFGB4hYw9FeevKTo4JvGs3e0ebA1fvicquNeXOY4XsycLe80uRnWibCJmE9NenY4dRrg7iaX7iaOvMzq7autKm8CcHlxx5kbnnyEegezLbzjSLAA%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}], "categories": null, "attachments": null, "extra": {}, "language": null, "summary": "Uni-Agent is an open‑source framework by veRL that unifies building, running, and training general agents. It modularizes agents into model, tool, and environment layers, enabling flexible integration of APIs or local inference backends. The framework runs agents at scale using veFaaS Sandbox micro‑VMs for secure, high‑concurrency execution across diverse environments, and provides a live dashboard. It also connects to the verl reinforcement‑learning engine, allowing agents to evolve through real‑world interactions and asynchronous training."}, "settings": {}}